  "mcp_definitions": "tasks.tools:TOOLS",
  "mcp_instructions": "Tasks: task_list, task_show, trace_show, run_result and locks read the project's tasks, traces and locks; task_open, task_escalate, task_report, task_answer, task_rebind, task_resolve and task_close are short writes. task_merge takes the task's workspace lock and the merge lock without waiting (a busy lock is refused naming its holder) and starts the merge as its own process. register_wait asks to be woken when a task reaches a state or is rebound to another main agent's session, a run ends or a lock is released; it never takes a lock for you.",
